How do you find the element that appears once when all others appear twice?
XOR all elements: x ^ x == 0 and x ^ 0 == x, and XOR is commutative, so pairs cancel and only the single element remains. O(n) time, O(1) space.'), 'C'),
  TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-10-07 03:23:53+00'
