    || setweight(to_tsvector('english', 'Searching & Counting Algorithms'), 'B')
    || setweight(to_tsvector('english', '<algorithm> has ~100 well-tested, optimised functions that work on iterator ranges. Knowing the common ones replaces most hand-written loops.
